  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Migrating from Camunda 7 to 8",
    "splashDescription": "envite consulting is a top-level Platinum Camunda Partner specializing in sustainable software and process engineering.                                          \nWith years of hands-on experience and three official Camunda Champions on our team, envite delivers structured, reliable, and future-proof migrations from Camunda 7 to Camunda 8.  \n  \n\nWhether acting as strategic consultants or developers embedded within your teams, we combine deep technical expertise with architectural clarity and a strong focus on quality assurance and long-term sustainability. Primarily serving the German-speaking DACH region, we support enterprises across the entire migration lifecycle from assessment and roadmap to data migration, validation, and long-term operational readiness while avoiding unnecessary complexity or risk.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/775500/overview/img8292933727103832205.png?49c890da53392eed9d192194985e88d4",
